{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/floridaadventuresandrentals/items/44214/", "pk": 44214, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/floridaadventuresandrentals/", "pk": 13096, "shortname": "floridaadventuresandrentals", "name": "Florida Adventures and Rentals", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "3 Hour Eco Tour", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 9, "unicode": "3 Hour Eco Tour", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": true, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 3.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 0.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 2, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 9312, "description": "# VOTED #1 ECO-TOUR ON MARCO ISLAND\n\n##Duration\n\n3 hours\n\n##Dolphin Sightings Guaranteed\n\nWe guarantee dolphin sightseeing during this tour or your will get your money back. Dolphins are non-migratory which means they are in the area year-round and our captains are very familiar with where to find them.\n\n\n## About\nOn our boat guided Eco-Tours, we launch from the Goodland Boat Park located at 750 Palm Point Dr, Goodland, FL 34140. We will take a boat ride from the Goodland Bay into the mangrove islands. On the way, we will teach you about the complex maze of mangroves that make up the 10,000 Islands and its inhabitants. Dolphins and manatees are very prevalent on this tour. Many shorebirds will be seen and identified to make your trip not only informational but, fun for all age groups. A stop on a deserted island for you to go shelling and collect some of the world-famous shells that can be found scattered along all the beaches. This is a semi-private, or private boat tour with a maximum of 14 guests on non private tours.\n\n\n## Departure Location\nWe depart from the **Goodland Boat Park located at 750 Palm Point Dr, Goodland, FL 34140.** This location includes a 5.22 acre park, restrooms, concessions for sale from sunscreen to food and allows easy access to the Ten Thousand Islands and Gulf of Mexico.\n\n\n##Customizable\nDepending on your preference and group size we have many different tour options to accommodate your party. Our 3 Hour Eco Tours are designed to accommodate everyone from individuals to groups of up to 17 people. Meet fellow adventurers and dolphin lovers or schedule a private boat tour for your group. We welcome individuals wanting to adventure on their own as well as large groups.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "Goodland Boat Park", "booking_notes": "![Thank you for booking](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/6HeSiQ6XQ2SGZN4lGJ7I)\n[![CLICK HERE FOR DIRECTIONS](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/ggr7BmDWRneMAwYCoEPO)](https://www.google.com/maps/dir/25.955731,-81.7238755/GOODLAND+BOATING+PARK/@25.9391063,-81.7682825,12z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m9!4m8!1m1!4e1!1m5!1m1!1s0x88daf10a7e5f5a7b:0xd9efbd83fb662eaa!2m2!1d-81.6464898!2d25.9217576?entry=ttu)", "cancellation_notes": "Customers will receive a full refund if they cancel their reservation 48 hours prior to the date and time of their booking, (customers will be charged in full within the 48 hour period before the booking). Changes on your reservation will be received 48 hours in advance, otherwise your will be charged in full for your original booking. Contact us by phone to cancel or inquire about a cancellation. No-shows will be charged the full price. Customers will also receive a full refund in case of operator cancellation due to weather or other unforeseen circumstances.", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 30, "headline": "Fun and educational for all age groups!", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/floridaadventuresandrentals/items/44214/images/327061/", "pk": 327061, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/lZ1iMDFeQi4GodXv1xVg", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/lZ1iMDFeQi4GodXv1xVg", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/floridaadventuresandrentals/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/floridaadventuresandrentals/items/44214/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/lZ1iMDFeQi4GodXv1xVg", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/lZ1iMDFeQi4GodXv1xVg", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/floridaadventuresandrentals/items/44214/images/192781/", "pk": 192781, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/88i2Sk2vTT2oX42D4qit", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/88i2Sk2vTT2oX42D4qit", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/floridaadventuresandrentals/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/floridaadventuresandrentals/items/44214/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/88i2Sk2vTT2oX42D4qit", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/88i2Sk2vTT2oX42D4qit", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/floridaadventuresandrentals/items/44214/images/192782/", "pk": 192782, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/F9m5K